# Optional: share-notification emails. Copy to .env (never commit it). Sharing works without email.

# Option A (recommended for Render free plan, which blocks SMTP ports): Brevo HTTPS API
# 1) Sign up at brevo.com  2) Senders & IP > Senders: add + verify your email  3) SMTP & API > API Keys: create a key
# BREVO_API_KEY=xkeysib-...
# MAIL_FROM_EMAIL=you@gmail.com        # must be a verified sender in Brevo

# Option B (local / hosts that allow SMTP): Gmail App Password
# SMTP_USER=you@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=abcdefghijklmnop

# Public URL used in email links
# APP_URL=https://your-app.onrender.com
